OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLong bright spells at first but
OL,6,Fclouding over through the morning with
OL,7,Fperhaps a few mainly light showers
OL,8,Fdeveloping through the afternoon.
OL,9,FTemperatures around normal for the
OL,10,Ftime of year. Light winds inland,
OL,11,Fbreezier near the coast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy with further mainly
OL,14,Flight showers this evening, especially
OL,15,Fnear the coast. After midnight most
OL,16,Fparts turning dry with clear spells
OL,17,Fdeveloping. A grass frost is possible
OL,18,Fin places.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
