OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA similar day to Monday with
OL,6,Fbright spells at first but cloud
OL,7,Fincreasing through the morning,
OL,8,Fshowers less frequent than Monday
OL,9,Fthough with many parts staying dry.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FHigh
OL,12,Fpressure continues to dominate in the
OL,13,Fcoming days, bringing generally cloudy
OL,14,Fconditions with occasional showers,
OL,15,Fand a gentle easterly breeze.
OL,16,FTemperatures remain around normal for
OL,17,Fthe time of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
